{
  "area": "website",
  "label": "Website",
  "module": null,
  "permission": "org.site.manage (layout requirePerm)",
  "nav": [
    {
      "label": "Übersicht",
      "key": "nav.overview",
      "href": "/website"
    },
    {
      "label": "Marke",
      "key": "website.brand.nav",
      "href": "/website/brand"
    },
    {
      "label": "Seiten",
      "key": "website.pages.nav",
      "href": "/website/pages"
    },
    {
      "label": "Domain",
      "key": "website.domain.nav",
      "href": "/website/domain"
    }
  ],
  "sharedParts": {
    "PublishBar": {
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/publish-bar.tsx",
      "notes": "Strip on every Website page except Domain: 'Unveröffentlichte Änderungen – nur in der Vorschau sichtbar.' / 'Alles veröffentlicht.'; 'Live ansehen' (new tab); when a draft is pending: 'Verwerfen' (data-confirm website.confirmDiscard → discardWebsite, toast 'Änderungen verworfen.') and 'Veröffentlichen' (publishWebsite, toast 'Veröffentlicht.', refreshes public cache). The draft is for the whole site, not per page."
    },
    "Preview": {
      "notes": "iframe of /site-preview?v=<version>[&page=event|portal], 75vh, sticky on lg, hint 'Vorschau des Entwurfs – aktualisiert sich beim Bearbeiten.'. Right column on lg, below the form on phones."
    },
    "AutoSave": {
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/autosave.tsx",
      "notes": "Every Website form saves the draft 1.2 s after the last input/change (autosaveWebsiteDraft) and router.refresh()es; status line 'Änderungen werden automatisch als Entwurf gespeichert.' → 'Speichert…' → 'Entwurf gespeichert – Vorschau aktualisiert.' / error. No SaveBar."
    }
  },
  "pages": [
    {
      "route": "/website",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/page.tsx",
      "title": "Website",
      "purpose": "See the public address, publish state and a setup checklist.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "size": null,
      "header": {
        "area": "website",
        "title": "Website",
        "description": "website.intro",
        "actions": [],
        "menu": []
      },
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "ok / error",
          "meaning": "toast"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "PublishBar",
          "kind": "custom"
        },
        {
          "title": "Adresse",
          "key": "website.address",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "notes": "public URL (own domain if live) as link in new tab; 'Zuletzt veröffentlicht: {when}'"
        },
        {
          "title": "Checkliste",
          "key": "website.checklist",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "notes": "Linked checks with done icon: Logo hochgeladen (→ /settings/general), Farben & Schrift festgelegt (→ /website/brand), Startseite gestaltet (→ /website/pages/start), Impressum ausgefüllt, Datenschutzerklärung ausgefüllt (→ /website/pages/legal), Eigene Domain verbunden (→ /website/domain)."
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "label": "Live ansehen",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "link",
          "target": "public site (new tab)"
        },
        {
          "label": "Verwerfen",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "confirm",
          "target": "discardWebsite",
          "confirm": true
        },
        {
          "label": "Veröffentlichen",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "serverAction",
          "target": "publishWebsite",
          "confirm": false
        }
      ],
      "links": [
        "/settings/general",
        "/website/brand",
        "/website/pages/start",
        "/website/pages/legal",
        "/website/domain"
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Area pages pass a description (website.intro, website.brand.intro, website.pages.intro, domains.intro) that PageHeader does not render on area pages – the intro texts (incl. the domain explanation with the roots URL) are never shown.",
        "Publish/Verwerfen live in a page strip, not in the header actions/primary; on phones there's no round + primary for Website.",
        "Logo check jumps out of the Website area to Settings › Allgemein (logo is edited there only)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/brand",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/brand/page.tsx",
      "title": "Marke",
      "purpose": "Set language, colours, fonts, corners and custom CSS for all public pages, with live preview.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "header": {
        "area": "website",
        "title": "Marke",
        "description": "website.brand.intro"
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Sprache",
          "key": "website.brand.language",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "theme.locale",
              "label": "Sprache",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "Choice",
              "required": true,
              "notes": "Browser / Deutsch / English"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Farben",
          "key": "website.brand.colors",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "theme.mode",
              "label": "Grundton",
              "key": "website.brand.mode",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "Choice",
              "required": true,
              "notes": "Hell / Dunkel"
            },
            {
              "name": "theme.background",
              "label": "Hintergrund",
              "type": "color",
              "component": "ColorField (color picker + hex Input)"
            },
            {
              "name": "theme.text",
              "label": "Text",
              "type": "color",
              "component": "ColorField"
            },
            {
              "name": "theme.accent",
              "label": "Akzent (Buttons, Links)",
              "type": "color",
              "component": "ColorField"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Schrift & Form",
          "key": "website.brand.type",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "theme.font_heading",
              "label": "Überschriften",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "FontField (NativeSelect + sample line)"
            },
            {
              "name": "theme.font_body",
              "label": "Fließtext",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "FontField (NativeSelect)"
            },
            {
              "name": "theme.radius",
              "label": "Ecken",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "Choice",
              "notes": "Eckig / Leicht rund / Rund"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Erweitert: eigenes CSS",
          "key": "website.brand.css",
          "kind": "custom",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "css",
              "label": "Erweitert: eigenes CSS",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "Textarea (mono)",
              "notes": "<details>, open when CSS exists"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Vorschau",
          "kind": "custom"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "label": "(autosave draft)",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "client",
          "target": "autosaveWebsiteDraft"
        }
      ],
      "phone": "Form above preview; preview iframe 75vh below the whole form.",
      "uxNotes": [
        "Font pickers are NativeSelect with many options while the other pickers on the same form are <Choice>."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/pages",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/pages/page.tsx",
      "title": "Seiten",
      "purpose": "List of the designable public pages with their state.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "header": {
        "area": "website",
        "title": "Seiten",
        "description": "website.pages.intro"
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Seiten",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "Link rows: Startseite ({n} Bausteine / Standard (Events)), Eventseite (eigenes HTML / Standard), Mitgliederbereich (eigenes HTML / leer), Kopf- & Fußzeile (eigenes HTML / leer), Impressum & Datenschutz (ausgefüllt / fehlt)."
        }
      ],
      "links": [
        "/website/pages/start",
        "/website/pages/event",
        "/website/pages/portal",
        "/website/pages/frame",
        "/website/pages/legal"
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Hand-made divided list instead of <DataTable> (no card view difference on phones needed, but inconsistent)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/pages/start",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/pages/start/page.tsx",
      "title": "Startseite",
      "purpose": "Design the public start page from blocks or own HTML template.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "header": {
        "crumbs": [
          "Seiten",
          "Startseite"
        ],
        "description": "site.intro"
      },
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "mode",
          "meaning": "blocks | html view; saving in a view makes it the start page's mode (hidden home_mode)"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Startseite aus: Bausteinen · eigenem HTML",
          "key": "website.html.mode",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "<Segments> links ?mode=blocks / ?mode=html"
        },
        {
          "title": "Kopf",
          "key": "site.headTitle",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "tagline",
              "label": "Untertitel",
              "key": "site.tagline",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input",
              "notes": "placeholder site.taglinePlaceholder; hint logo/name from Einstellungen → Allgemein"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Bausteine",
          "key": "site.blocksTitle",
          "kind": "custom",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "blocks",
              "label": "per block: Anzeigen (checkbox), Nach oben/Nach unten/Entfernen (icon buttons)",
              "type": "json",
              "component": "SiteEditor"
            },
            {
              "name": "title",
              "label": "Überschrift / Überschrift (optional)",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "label": "Text",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "Textarea",
              "notes": "hero/portal short; text block Markdown"
            },
            {
              "name": "button_label / button_href",
              "label": "Button-Text / Button-Link",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input",
              "notes": "hero"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "label": "Wie viele Events / Wie viele Produkte",
              "type": "number",
              "component": "Input"
            },
            {
              "name": "category",
              "label": "Kategorie",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "NativeSelect",
              "notes": "shop"
            },
            {
              "name": "event_id",
              "label": "Event",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "NativeSelect",
              "notes": "upcoming events, max 50 loaded"
            },
            {
              "name": "form_slug",
              "label": "Formular",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "NativeSelect"
            },
            {
              "name": "items[]",
              "label": "Text / Link (+ Link hinzufügen, max 12)",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input pairs",
              "notes": "links block"
            },
            {
              "name": "adding",
              "label": "Baustein",
              "key": "site.blockType",
              "type": "select",
              "component": "NativeSelect + 'Baustein hinzufügen'",
              "notes": "types: Großer Einstieg, Text, Links, Kommende Events, Ein Event hervorheben, Formular, Mitgliederbereich, Wissen, Shop (by active modules); max 30"
            }
          ],
          "notes": "Empty: 'Noch keine Bausteine – die Seite zeigt dann nur Logo und Name.'"
        },
        {
          "title": "Eigenes HTML (mode=html)",
          "key": "website.html.title",
          "kind": "custom",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "home_html",
              "label": "HTML der Startseite",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "HtmlEditor (Textarea + 'Einfügen:' snippet buttons)",
              "notes": "STARTER template when empty"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Vorschau",
          "kind": "custom"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "label": "Entfernen (Baustein)",
          "where": "row",
          "kind": "client",
          "confirm": false,
          "result": "block gone from draft after autosave; Verwerfen restores"
        },
        {
          "label": "Baustein hinzufügen",
          "key": "site.addBlock",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "client"
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Block reorder by up/down buttons only, no drag.",
        "Removing a block autosaves into the draft without confirm (recoverable only by discarding the whole draft).",
        "Event picker loads max 50 upcoming events into a NativeSelect (app.md: pickers search on the server).",
        "Mode switch is a URL param but becomes persistent only through autosave of the hidden home_mode field."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/pages/event",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/pages/event/page.tsx",
      "title": "Eventseite",
      "purpose": "Choose roots' standard event page or an own HTML template for all event pages.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "header": {
        "crumbs": [
          "Seiten",
          "Eventseite"
        ],
        "description": "website.event.intro"
      },
      "urlState": [
        {
          "param": "mode",
          "meaning": "standard | html"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Standard · Eigene Vorlage",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "<Segments>"
        },
        {
          "title": "Vorlage für Eventseiten (html)",
          "kind": "custom",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "event_html",
              "label": "HTML",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "HtmlEditor kind=event",
              "notes": "EVENT_STARTER; snippets incl. {{tickets}}, {{timetable}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Standard",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "notes": "hint website.event.standardHint; when an own template exists: button 'Standard-Eventseite verwenden' (submits empty event_html)"
        },
        {
          "title": "Vorschau",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "/site-preview?page=event"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "label": "Standard-Eventseite verwenden",
          "key": "website.event.useStandard",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "serverAction",
          "target": "saveWebsiteDraft (event_html='')",
          "confirm": false,
          "result": "own template cleared in draft; toast 'Entwurf gespeichert – noch nicht öffentlich.'"
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Only page in the area with an explicit submit button (others autosave only); clearing the template has no confirm.",
        "Switching segment to 'Standard' alone does not change anything – the user must press the button, unlike the start page where the view switch + autosave changes the mode."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/pages/portal",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/pages/portal/page.tsx",
      "title": "Mitgliederbereich",
      "purpose": "Own HTML welcome area at the top of the signed-in member portal.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "header": {
        "crumbs": [
          "Seiten",
          "Mitgliederbereich"
        ],
        "description": "website.portal.intro"
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Willkommensbereich",
          "key": "website.portal.welcome",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "portal_html",
              "label": "HTML",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "HtmlEditor kind=portal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Vorschau",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "/site-preview?page=portal; PublishBar 'Live ansehen' opens /portal"
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "The page is always HTML-only (no blocks/standard switch like start and event pages)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/pages/frame",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/pages/frame/page.tsx",
      "title": "Kopf- & Fußzeile",
      "purpose": "Own HTML above and below every public page.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "header": {
        "crumbs": [
          "Seiten",
          "Kopf- & Fußzeile"
        ],
        "description": "website.frame.intro"
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "HTML",
          "key": "website.frame.html",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "header_html",
              "label": "Kopfzeile",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "Textarea (mono)"
            },
            {
              "name": "footer_html",
              "label": "Fußzeile",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "Textarea (mono)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Vorschau",
          "kind": "custom"
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "Plain textareas without the snippet helper used on the other HTML pages."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/pages/legal",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/pages/legal/page.tsx",
      "title": "Impressum & Datenschutz",
      "purpose": "Edit Markdown imprint and privacy policy (linked at the bottom of every public page).",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "header": {
        "crumbs": [
          "Seiten",
          "Impressum & Datenschutz"
        ],
        "description": "site.legalHint"
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Impressum",
          "key": "site.imprint",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "imprint",
              "label": "Impressum",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "Textarea",
              "notes": "prefilled from invoice settings (org_billing) when empty"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Datenschutz",
          "key": "site.privacy",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "privacy",
              "label": "Datenschutz",
              "type": "textarea",
              "component": "Textarea",
              "notes": "placeholder site.privacyPlaceholder"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "No preview here although the other page editors have one.",
        "The imprint prefill from org_billing is only a default value: it looks filled in the form but the checklist counts it as missing until autosave stores it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "route": "/website/domain",
      "file": "src/app/(app)/website/domain/page.tsx",
      "title": "Domain",
      "purpose": "Connect one own domain: enter it, copy DNS records, wait until live; remove it.",
      "permission": "org.site.manage",
      "size": "form (max-w-3xl wrapper)",
      "header": {
        "area": "website",
        "title": "Domain",
        "description": "domains.intro"
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "(not configured)",
          "kind": "custom",
          "notes": "'Eigene Domains sind auf dieser roots-Installation noch nicht eingerichtet.' when no Vercel env"
        },
        {
          "title": "Domain verbinden",
          "key": "domains.connectTitle",
          "anchor": "#connect",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "domain",
              "label": "Eure Domain",
              "key": "domains.domain",
              "type": "text",
              "component": "Input inputMode=url",
              "required": true,
              "notes": "placeholder tickets.euerverein.de"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "<domain> status",
          "anchor": "#status",
          "kind": "FormCard",
          "notes": "Badge 'Verbunden' / 'Wartet auf DNS' (spinner), 'Zuletzt geprüft {when}', problem text, 'Jetzt prüfen', live text + 'Seite öffnen'. DomainPoller re-checks while pending."
        },
        {
          "title": "So verbindet ihr die Domain",
          "anchor": "#dns",
          "kind": "custom",
          "columns": [
            "Typ",
            "Name / Host (+ Kopieren)",
            "Wert / Ziel (+ Kopieren)"
          ],
          "notes": "3 steps, raw <table> of DNS records + tips (apex, full name, replace, Cloudflare, TXT)"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "label": "Domain verbinden",
          "key": "domains.connect",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "serverAction",
          "target": "connectDomainAction",
          "result": "toast 'Domain hinzugefügt. Jetzt fehlen nur noch die DNS-Einträge.' or invalid/taken/onlyOne"
        },
        {
          "label": "Jetzt prüfen",
          "key": "domains.checkNow",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "serverAction",
          "target": "checkNowAction",
          "result": "toast 'Eure Domain ist live.' when active, otherwise silent"
        },
        {
          "label": "Kopieren",
          "where": "row",
          "kind": "client",
          "target": "clipboard"
        },
        {
          "label": "Seite öffnen",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "link",
          "target": "https://<domain>"
        },
        {
          "label": "Domain entfernen",
          "key": "domains.remove",
          "where": "section",
          "kind": "confirm",
          "target": "removeDomainAction",
          "confirm": true,
          "result": "toast 'Domain entfernt.'"
        }
      ],
      "uxNotes": [
        "No PublishBar here (domain is not part of the draft) – the only Website page without it.",
        "'Domain entfernen' is a ghost red button at the page bottom, not a ⋯ menu item.",
        "'Jetzt prüfen' gives no feedback when still pending (back with no message)."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
